  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'welcome to the protocol - 149 demo !


    this game is centered around
    dodging missiles in space, if you are hit you die.


    the 4 words at the top
    left of the sceen are used as buttons to navigate between the menus, go to scenario
    to get to gameplay or customise your fuel and battery space with the garage.


    movement
    consumes energy, if your reactor cannot supply enough energy then batteries are
    used, if you batteries are empty then the ship wont move.


    fuel is consumed
    when moving, if you have no fuel you cant move :(


    the nav ball (blue sphere)
    gives you the relative position of a missile in relation to your ship.


    hav
    fun pilot ;)'
